{
  "id": "1-4",
  "chapter": 1,
  "order": 4,
  "kind": "practice",
  "title": "算式工坊",
  "mode": "online",
  "allowLocalFile": true,
  "language": "asm",
  "prerequisites": [
    "1-3"
  ],
  "concepts": [
    "composition",
    "temp-register",
    "preserve-inputs"
  ],
  "ui": {
    "immediatePort": true,
    "debugControls": true
  },
  "goalSummary": {
    "before": "t0 与 t1 中存有输入整数，t3 为空闲暂存槽",
    "after": "计算 t2 = 3 × t0 - t1 + 5，且保持 t0 与 t1 的原值不被修改"
  },
  "briefing": [
    {
      "tag": "任务背景",
      "text": "温控校准模块上线！本关没有新指令，考验你用已学的加减与暂存组合出多步公式。"
    },
    {
      "tag": "通关目标",
      "text": "计算校准值 `t2 = 3 × t0 - t1 + 5`，同时**不要改动 `t0` 和 `t1` 原值**。从本关起右侧开放了「单步」调试。"
    }
  ],
  "sandbox": {
    "type": "manual-cpu",
    "modules": [
      "regs",
      "constants",
      "alu"
    ],
    "recordToAsm": true,
    "focusRegs": [
      "t0",
      "t1",
      "t2",
      "t3"
    ],
    "regRoles": {
      "t0": "输入 A",
      "t1": "输入 B",
      "t2": "输出"
    },
    "constantCards": [
      {
        "label": "5",
        "value": 5,
        "kind": "immediate"
      }
    ],
    "aluOps": [
      "+",
      "-"
    ],
    "allowCopy": true,
    "warmupPuzzle": {
      "prompt": "本关没有新指令！用 t3 当草稿纸，一步步算出 3 × t0(4) - t1(3) + 5 = 14 放入 t2，同时别改坏 t0 和 t1。",
      "initial": {
        "regs": {
          "t0": 4,
          "t1": 3,
          "t2": 0,
          "t3": 0
        }
      },
      "goal": {
        "regs": {
          "t0": 4,
          "t1": 3,
          "t2": 14
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "editor": {
    "readonlyPrefix": 1,
    "readonlySuffix": 1
  },
  "hints": [
    {
      "level": 1,
      "type": "diagram",
      "content": "没有乘法指令时，3 × t0 就是先算 2 × t0（t0 + t0），再加一次 t0。"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "type": "steps",
      "content": "1. t3 = t0 + t0；2. t3 = t3 + t0；3. t3 = t3 - t1；4. t2 = t3 + 5。全程不写回 t0 和 t1。"
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "type": "snippet",
      "content": "add  t3, t0, t0\nadd  t3, t3, t0\nsub  t3, t3, t1\naddi t2, t3, 5"
    }
  ],
  "wikiRefs": [
    "rv32-arithmetic"
  ]
}
